# STAFFRPT.FRM -- the staff salary report, grouped by department (use it
# with STAFF.DBF ordered by STAFFDPT.NDX).  Option byte 1: no page eject
# before the first page.
REPORT STAFFRPT.FRM
TITLE INITECH SYSTEMS CORPORATION;STAFF SALARY REPORT
PAGE 80 58 2 0 1
GROUP DEPT|Department
COLUMN 14 0 N LASTNAME|Last Name
COLUMN 10 0 N FIRSTNAME|First Name
COLUMN 8 0 N HIRED|Hired
COLUMN 10 2 Y SALARY|Salary
